namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Animated::changeCenterOffsetTo(Offset value, number durationSeconds, int easing)
\brief Animate the rotation-center offset to a target.

Changes the pivot offset, not the location. Durations are explicit floating-point seconds. Zero applies immediately; a request after wait() or andThen() must have positive duration.

\param value Pivot offset in the owning object coordinate system.
\param durationSeconds Finite nonnegative duration in seconds.
\param easing Integer easing constant; elapsed time and duration use seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see setCenterOffset(), changeCenterOffsetBy()
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Animated::changeCenterOffsetTo(number x, number y, number durationSeconds, int easing)
\brief Animate the rotation-center offset to a target.

Changes the pivot offset, not the location. Durations are explicit floating-point seconds. Zero applies immediately; a request after wait() or andThen() must have positive duration.

\param x Pivot offset in the owning object coordinate system.
\param y Pivot offset in the owning object coordinate system.
\param durationSeconds Finite nonnegative duration in seconds.
\param easing Integer easing constant; elapsed time and duration use seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see setCenterOffset(), changeCenterOffsetBy()
*/
 }
